  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In a mountain cave he argues that without risks they cannot break free of their cage. He has gained the heavenly spirit’s trust and created immortal killer move blood light spirit suppression, which needs all three sworn siblings. Zhou Min and Zheng Tuo urge caution and help from Old Immortal Chen Chi. Feng Jun cultivates luck path and reports an ominous feeling that if they do not act now they may lose the chance. Zhou Min notes he once climbed Immortal Succession Mountain and cultivated its luck path inheritance; even below rank seven, as first inheritor his dao marks are not less than a rank seven luck path Gu Immortal’s.",
      "chapters": [
        1119
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhou_min",
        "char_zheng_tuo",
        "char_chen_chi",
        "loc_immortal_succession_mountain",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the succession bell rings ten times he darkens, reading the stone tablet to mean a main tribe inheritor of Hei Fan’s true inheritance has arrived. He resists paying respects, then calms enough to go meet the arrival without exposing their plan.",
      "chapters": [
        1119
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "main-tribe-inheritor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_hei_fan_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He arrives with Zhou Min and Zheng Tuo. Fang Yuan notes Feng Jun and Zhou Min as rank six. Feng Jun greets respectfully but holds animosity and watches with an unkind expression. He asks about Fang Yuan’s eagle and hears it named an upper extreme heavenly eagle.",
      "chapters": [
        1120
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "meeting-hei-cheng",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    }
  ],
